!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = tissue: anterior cingulate cortex
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype: humanized aSyn WT mice
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = RNA was extracted from the anterior cingulate cortex of mice treated under each condition, with four replicates per condition. 2-month-old humanized WT αSyn mice (FVB; 129S6-Sncatm1Nbm Tg (SNCA)1Nbm/J, Strain: 010710), obtained from The Jackson Laboratory (Bar Harbor, ME, USA), were used for RNA sequencing experiments. The mice were divided into five groups: the PBS group (intranasal administration of PBS), the PM2.5 group (intranasal administration of PM2.5), the PFF group (PFF injection), the PM-PFF group (PM-PFF injection), and the PM-PFF with PM2.5 exposure group (PM-PFF injection followed by intranasal PM2.5 administration one week later). All treatments were administered for a duration of 2 months.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Sequencing libraries were prepared using the RNeasy Lipid Tissue Mini Kit, following the manufacturer's protocol.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = NEBNext® Ultra II Directional RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina®.
!Sample_description = Library name: PFFA2749
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were initially quality-checked with FastQC  v0.11.8, followed by trimming with Trimmomatic v0.39 when necessary. The quality-checked reads were then aligned to the mouse genome (mm10)  using HISAT2 v2.2.1. Gene-level expression was quantified using featureCounts  based on GENCODE release M25.
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: tab-delimited text file includes raw counts for each sample
!Sample_platform_id = GPL34290
